# X Training: the VO2max block (PLANS.md section 7).
#
# Written for level 2 and four runs a week. Notation: README.md. After
# editing, run gen_plans.py and look at the golden files' diff.
#
# No race: the block opens and closes with a 5K time trial, its main measure.

plan     vo2max
id       3
name     VO2max block
race     0
minweeks 8
long     1 45 65
long     2 60 80
long     3 70 95

# Week 1 opens with the time trial. With a 5K from the last six weeks it is
# this instead (PLANS.md section 7).
recentweek baseline | *INT 5x2 | E+S 40   | 30/30 2x6               | L 60

#    phase      first quality      easy        second quality          long
week baseline | E+S 40           | E 35      | 30/30 2x6               | *TT5
week build    | *INT 5x3         | E+S 40    | 30/30 2x8               | L 65
week build    | *INT 4x4         | E+S 40    | HILLS 8x60s             | L 70
week cutback  | *INT 4x3         | E 35      | E+S 35                  | L 55
week build    | *INT 6x3         | E+S 45    | 30/30 2x10              | L 75
week build    | *INT 4x4 jog 2:00 | E+S 45   | HILLS 10x60s            | L 75
week peak     | *INT 6x3 jog 90s | E+S 45    | 30/30 3x8               | L 80
week retest   | INT 3x3          | E 30      | E 25                    | *TT5
